@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #55506A
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  FontSize 15
  FontColor #17132B
  BorderColor #55506A
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}
rectangle "AI Agent" as Agent #F3EFFF
rectangle "Structured intent" as Intent
rectangle "Foundgine semantic execution boundary" as F #EEF9EF
rectangle "Provider plan" as Plan
rectangle "Execution + evidence" as Exec #EDF9F3
Agent --> Intent
Intent --> F
F --> Plan
Plan --> Exec
note right of F
Capability discovery is descriptive.
Authorization is evaluated for
every actual operation.
end note
@enduml
